        <p class="lede">
          Bob's Red Mill protein powder is a good single-ingredient pantry staple but a weak workout shake: the whey gives 14 g of protein per scoop, the almond 20 g and the hemp 12 g, none with sweeteners. Your goal decides whether that suits you. Below we cover every label, gluten-free status, testing, cost per 25 g and the discontinued pea protein.
