              <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                  No. None of Bob's Red Mill's protein powders lists NSF, Informed Choice, Informed Sport or Clean Label Project certification, and the brand does not publish heavy metal results for them. Bob's Red Mill does say its facilities are audited annually to the SQF food safety standard and that its products are kosher certified, but those programs do not test finished powders for banned substances or contaminants.
