                  Buyers most often mention small servings, so it takes nearly two scoops of whey to reach 25 g of protein. Hemp buyers report an earthy taste and a gritty texture, and some were unhappy when it stopped being produced gluten free. A few whey buyers find the plain flavor raw in water. Others note the price is higher than bulk unflavored powders.
