                  Bob's Red Mill pea protein powder is no longer listed on bobsredmill.com, and we found no current listing on Amazon when we checked in November 2026, so treat it as discontinued. The brand's current protein powders are whey concentrate, almond and hemp. For a similar single-ingredient pea protein, Naked Pea gives 27 g of protein per serving and costs about $0.71 per 25 g in its 5 lb bag.
